Package: apsimwise
Title: Unified Access to the APSIMWISE Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", email = "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified interface to R packages supporting the
    Agricultural Production Systems sIMulator (APSIM), crop modelling,
    weather analysis, and agricultural decision support. It simplifies
    installation and loading of related packages and provides consistent
    user-facing functions across multiple crop types.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
